=== talk-kawaguchi

--- start
KAWAGUCHI: "Every advocate who makes it up these stairs thinks their bill is the one the ceiling bends for." He taps the referral sheet. "Bring me something the floor survives, and we'll talk about ceilings."
POLICY BRAIN: The ceiling is a CHOICE. Someone typed it into a spreadsheet. Ask which one.
PROCEDURE: The man guards the referral sheet. You will need him more than he needs you.

* "Noted, chair."
  {}
  He almost smiles. Almost.
